---
import PersonalBaseLayout from '../layouts/PersonalBaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = "Now";
---

<PersonalBaseLayout title={pageTitle}>
	<h1>Personal</h1>
	<p>
		For October, I've decided to give myself a challenge rather than pick from the multitude of them 
		happening this month. So this month I'll be working on my two greatest weaknesses: resting and 
		finishing my personal projects. So far, I've already had to force myself to not overdo it like 
		twice haha.
	</p>
	<div class="divider" style="padding-left:4em"></div>
	<h1>Projects and Things I'm Playing With</h1>
	<p>
		Social Stealth Game - this is the "Scope Testing Project" from before I'm just slowly revealing a 
		bit more about it.
	</p>
	<p>
		Various Tinkerings - This is still going on, but feels slightly different since I'm working a lot
		on scripts from game ideas to see if I can set myself up for success if I decided to pursue one later.
	</p>
	<div class="divider" style="padding-left:4em"></div>
	<h1>Media</h1>
	<dl>
		<dt><h2>Games</h2></dt>
		<dd>Drakengard 1</dd>
		<dd>Touhou Koumakyou: New Classic (trying to beat Patchouli Knowledge)</dd>
		<dd>Dressmaker</dd>
		<dt><h2>Most Recent Movie</h2></dt>
		<dd>Reinfield</dd>
		<dt><h2>Shows</h2></dt>
		<dd>Gregory Horror Show</dd>
		<dt><h2>Books</h2></dt>
		<dd>We Need Your Art: Stop Messing Around and Make Something (just finished)</dd>
		<dd>The Black Girl Survives This One</dd>
	</dl>

		<script>
			import '../scripts/menu.js'
		  </script>
</PersonalBaseLayout>

<style>
	main {
		margin: auto;
		padding: 1rem;
		width: 800px;
		max-width: calc(100% - 2rem);
		font-size: 20px;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	img {
    float:left;
	padding: 2%;
	}
	.astro-a {
		position: absolute;
		top: -32px;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translatex(-50%);
		width: 220px;
		height: auto;
		z-index: -1;
	}
	h1 {
		font-size: 4rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1;
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 0em;
	}
	.link-card-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(24ch, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
		padding: 0;
	}

</style>
